WEBVTT

00:05:27.448 --> 00:05:31.158
so that's the way it is developed.

00:05:31.548 --> 00:05:34.468
But let's talk about education.

00:05:34.468 --> 00:05:37.408
I think, even though education is

00:05:37.408 --> 00:05:41.008
the cornerstone of the entire work 
of the Foundation,

00:05:41.008 --> 00:05:44.715
the Foundation was very keen 
of building an entire ecosystem

00:05:44.715 --> 00:05:48.024
to provide the complete cycle 
of the students

00:05:48.024 --> 00:05:53.123
going from K to 12 education, 
into undergrad, into postgraduate,

00:05:53.123 --> 00:05:55.268
where Hamad Bin Khalifa University

00:05:55.268 --> 00:05:58.888
comes as a research-oriented, 
research-intensive university

00:05:58.888 --> 00:06:00.956
and providing the ability 
for the students